@startuml
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class CancerStageComponent {
  code : CodeableConcept [1..1]
  value : CodeableConcept [1..1]
}

note right of CancerStageComponent::code
Identifies the staging component
being reported.

Examples:
- "FIGO stage group"
- "T", "N", "M" (TNM)
end note

note right of CancerStageComponent::value
Staging value associated
with the component.

Examples:
- "IIIB"
- "T2", "N0", "M0"
end note
@enduml
